        16,
        -624
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 520,
        "height": 1000,
        "content": "## AI Data Assistant on Telegram: weather, FX, crypto and Indonesian public data\n\n### How it works\n\nThis workflow turns a Telegram bot into an AI data assistant. Users send a message in natural language and the AI agent picks the right tool to answer: current weather, foreign exchange rates, crypto prices, gold price, earthquakes in Indonesia, Bank Indonesia rates, Jakarta power supply, or Indonesian holidays. Every query is logged to Google Sheets with the answer, each conversation keeps a short memory window, and a weekly briefing is sent to the owner every Monday.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Create a Telegram bot with @BotFather and add the bot token to the Telegram Trigger and Reply nodes.\n- Connect your OpenAI credential on the model nodes.\n- Connect Google Sheets and set the spreadsheet and sheet used to log queries.\n- Add the StudioAPI header credential for the earthquakes, BI rates, holidays and power tools.\n- Send a message to your bot to test.\n\n### Customization\n\nAdd more tools, change the memory window, or adjust the system prompt to broaden what the assistant can answer."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
